  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n''Note: this page is about donkey stables, not to be confused with [[Horse Stable|horse stable]]s.''\n\n[[File:Donkey Stable.png|200px|left|Donkey stable]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Animal Shelters|Animal Shelter]]\n |level = 43 • 55\n |price = 25,000\n |houses = {{Infoicon|provd|big|link=Provence Donkey}}{{Infoicon|andalud|big|link=Andalusian Donkey}}{{Infoicon|anatold|big|link=Anatolian Donkey}} x3\n}}\n'''Donkey stables''' are shelters for [[:Category:Donkeys|donkeys]]. The first house is unlocked at [[experience]] level 43.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Appearance'''===\n[[File:Provence Donkey Hungry.png|150px|left]]\nThe stable is an old blue stall with hay inside it. However, donkeys never go into the stall or eat the hay. They eat [[carrot]]s and sleep in front of the stable.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Building'''===\nEach stable costs 25,000 {{Infoicon|coin}} and can hold up to three donkeys. The second stable is unlocked at level 55. Building them takes no time.\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Eselstall\n|es = Establo de burros\n|fr = Écurie pour ânes\n|it = Stalla per asini\n|no = Eselstall\n}}\n[[Category:Animal Shelters]]",
